{
  "bookId": "hero-211104",
  "id": "bond-37903",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37903001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好了，小奏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我到了……植物园。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所有的设施和花草都是按照手办比例布置的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "就像回到了学校里一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "为什么要送给我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是奖励，这段时间手办们得到了你的很多帮助。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我并没有做得很好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "并不是哦，看这些。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "这是……?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "给「天使小姐」的感谢信，是手办们亲手写的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……我只是很高兴，有大家在我身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那是当然的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37903015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "有些话……想要对你说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
